    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## COVE2E Status Polling & Follow-up\n**Webhook path (default):** the backend posts an action. If action_type = RAISE_FOLLOW_UP the workflow first POSTs .../query with direction USER, then always GETs the claim and responds with the snapshot.\n\n**Scheduled path (optional):** the disabled Schedule Trigger fires every 30 minutes and reuses the same GET. To enable it:\n1. Set COVE2E_BACKEND_URL and COVE2E_POLL_CLAIM_ID (the external claim id to poll) in the n8n environment.\n2. Enable the Schedule Trigger node and activate the workflow.\n\nScheduled runs skip the Respond to Webhook node (there is no HTTP caller) and end at \"Scheduled Poll Done\". Push results back to the backend from there if needed.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "f6b5c1d7-0006-4c1a-9a06-000000000013",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, -80]
    }
